<tr class="mktoModule" id="Body_copy"> 
<td align="center" valign="top"> 
<table width="640" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center" style="width:640px;" class="em_wrapper" bgcolor="#ffffff"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" style="padding:40px 42px 0px 42px;" class="em_ptrl1"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" align="center"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-size:16px; line-height:24px; color:#223341; font-family:'Chivo', Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;" class="em_green"> 
<div id="text_01" class="mktoText"> 
<p><img src="https://more.flywire.com/rs/372-QSQ-649/images/flywire logo.png" alt="flywire logo.png" height="67" width="200" constrain="true" imagepreview="false" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" /></p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p></p> 
<p>Thank you for attending the&nbsp;<strong>Bursars SFS 2020 Virtual Conference</strong>! While we miss being face-to-face, PDG did a great job of making sure that we still had an amazing event full of learnings and best practices.</p> 
<p><br /></p> 
<p>Let's keep the good times rolling!&nbsp;<span style="color: #444444; font-family: Chivo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; 
-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;">We created a<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="border-collapse: collapse; font-family: Chivo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; 
letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: #48b985;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/education/virtual-booth?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=pdg-bursars" target="_blank" style="border-collapse: collapse; color: #48b985;"><strong>Virtual Booth</strong></a></span><span style="color: #444444; font-family: Chivo, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: 
normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: #ffffff; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;"><span>&nbsp;</span>where you can chat with the Flywire booth staff, view content, attend speaking sessions, and learn more about our Comprehensive Receivables Solution. You can also enter to win a swag pack (we even have hand sanitizer!)</span><br /> <br /><a href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/education/virtual-booth?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=pdg-bursars" target="_blank"><img src="https://more.flywire.com/rs/372-QSQ-649/images/flywire-virtual-booth-hi.jpg" alt="flywire-virtual-booth-hi.jpg" height="236" width="450" constrain="true" imagepreview="false" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" /></a><br /></p> 
</div></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table></td> 
</tr>
